Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白 好小！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:13.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有過跟小空一樣小的時候哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:17.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要看再長大一點的照片？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:18.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看是哪一本...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這個小姑娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是蝶華姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這是不是我們剛認識時候的照片啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:38.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,剛開始的時候 小白特別怕生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:40.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一跟你搭話 就變得扭扭捏捏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:45.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小時候的事情了 記不太清楚了 應該是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:46.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:49.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆是什麼時候開始變成好朋友的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:51.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那應該是在...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:00:59.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:01.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我還記得這棵樹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就是在這裡確立關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:08.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們結交的契機 究竟是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這關鍵的地方 具體的我也想不起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:18.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,再去這裡一趟 說不定就能想起來了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:20.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也想去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:25.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:29.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}兩個人是好朋友♡ 回憶的大樹！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.81,0:03:20.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.01,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,山真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這叫做紅葉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:30.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你們回憶中的大樹 到底在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:34.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說吧 具體的地方我也記不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,上次來還是很久以前了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.27,0:03:39.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學記得嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候我更小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:45.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟由由阿姨打聽了一下 她跟我說...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:50.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,“你們自己去找吧 就像尋寶一樣 會更有趣哦”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:52.53,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,尋寶很有趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:53.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:57.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,先到今天留宿的節子阿婆家裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:04:01.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,上次來也受她關照 說不定知道點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華和真白都長大了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,唐突叨嘮 真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就喜歡熱鬧 小朋友們也熱烈歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:30.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:33.02,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咯咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咯咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,想起來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:45.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次來這裡的時候 也在這裡喝過茶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:50.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,節子阿婆 你知道這棵樹嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？是哪棵啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:05:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有印象 具體的位置就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:02.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:05.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,樹 找不到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,正要開始找呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們四處逛逛 邊散步邊找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:12.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.49,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,散步！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也帶阿白一起去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:21.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿白？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:26.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 那什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:27.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿白是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,雪白雪白的 眼睛圓溜溜的 很可愛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.55,0:05:35.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為是小狗呢 嚇了我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:37.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:39.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:45.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,散步 散步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.21,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,和阿白一起散步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:01.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有的地方跟以前不一樣了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這條路有來過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:07.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是說 那棵樹肯定就在前方！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:10.74,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,鞦韆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:17.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主 我知道你很想玩 現在就忍一忍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:22.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,作為交換 等找到了那棵樹 我陪你一起玩鞦韆 玩到舒暢...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼 快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼 等會再玩！忍住！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不是啊 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:37.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 等等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,找到現在都沒找到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這一帶還有印象嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次大概沒有來過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:25.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是真美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:36.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這裡是跟大伙一起找到的 新的回憶的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們該回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:46.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 啊 帽子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:48.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就拿回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:00.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候 好像也是帽子...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:07.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,在最後發現了關鍵線索呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:11.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩 咩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等會請教我做法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然就是個普通的家常菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要找的是回憶裡的那課樹嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:43.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經找到線索了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:45.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,漸漸地回想了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:51.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候也是去散步 然後我的帽子被風吹跑了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:57.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶幫我去追
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子不停地飛...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,掛到了那棵樹上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:18.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 後來的事情就想不起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:21.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我們究竟發生了什麼故事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:26.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是小蝶姐想辦法拿到了帽子 拉近了你們的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:31.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但是照片裡的真白沒有戴帽子啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:38.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:40.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒有注意到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿欸嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:50.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子還掛在樹上 你們怎麼就變要好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個哪個...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這棵樹 我想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道在哪裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道是知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:26.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,節子阿婆告訴我們的 就是這裡了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:30.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是昨天第一個來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:33.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:43.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,跟節子阿婆說的一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那棵樹被去年的颱風吹斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到痕跡就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:11:01.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那時候的事情也都想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真白妹妹 我幫你去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:25.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:27.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:29.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:31.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:32.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:35.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:37.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 沒事 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶 很痛痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:46.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,去醫院吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:53.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你看我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:54.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真的沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:08.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠們是不是很喜歡帽子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:15.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:26.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼 我其實想跟小蝶你交朋友的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經是朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:32.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我以後能叫你小白嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:47.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟小蝶就是這樣拍下了那張照片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:54.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 謝謝你讓我們結交
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,還要感謝松鼠們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（吱吱 吱吱）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:02.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那個鞦韆就是用這棵樹做成的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:07.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對松鼠們來說 這棵樹肯定也是寶貴的回憶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:08.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:13.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起興奮不已 心動不止 像尋寶一樣找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:16.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,留下了很多很多寶貴的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:17.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,回憶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那大伙一起拍張照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.35,0:13:23.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吱吱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那我拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:47.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,5 4 3 2 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:47.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:48.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,1...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:50.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（快門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:51.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:57.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:04.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:18.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！居然追到這裡來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我們寶貴的地方啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:22.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:23.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
